237
00:12:11,425 --> 00:12:14,258
Ha, oʻshani nazarda tutgan boʻlishi kerak.

238
00:12:14,281 --> 00:12:17,756
Ana oʻsha qizil belgi nima?

239
00:12:17,779 --> 00:12:21,383
„Tegrma“ deb yozilgan.

240
00:12:21,407 --> 00:12:25,941
Mashinaga tegmang degani, shundaymi?

241
00:12:25,963 --> 00:12:28,597
Ha, shunday.

242
00:12:28,620 --> 00:12:32,310
Bu yerda „Chekish taqiqlanadi“ deb yozilgan.

243
00:12:32,333 --> 00:12:36,766
Bu yerda chekish mumkin emas degani.

244
00:12:36,789 --> 00:12:39,598
Shunda bu yerda chekib boʻlmaydi.

245
00:12:39,622 --> 00:12:43,468
Ha, tashqaridagi chekish joyida chekaylik.

246
00:12:43,491 --> 00:12:48,291
Aytgancha, boʻlim boshligʻi kel, degan edi.

247
00:12:48,314 --> 00:12:52,363
Ofisga kel degani, shundaymi?

248
00:12:52,386 --> 00:12:55,964
Shoshil, deb ham aytdi.

249
00:12:55,988 --> 00:12:59,468
Tezroq qayt degani.

250
00:12:59,491 --> 00:13:02,225
Ha, shoshilaylik.

251
00:13:02,248 --> 00:13:04,414
Tushunarli.

252
00:13:04,437 --> 00:13:05,937
9-SAHNA: Tort pishirishda yordam berish / Tort tayyorlashda yordam

253
00:13:05,937 --> 00:13:09,373
Endi tort tayyorlaymiz.

254
00:13:09,397 --> 00:13:11,164
Yaxshi ekan!

255
00:13:11,187 --> 00:13:15,063
Retsept kitobidagi tartibda tayyorlaymiz.

256
00:13:15,086 --> 00:13:17,501
Qiyin boʻlmaydimi?

257
00:13:17,525 --> 00:13:22,491
Video darslikdagi ustoz aytganidek qilsangiz, muammo boʻlmaydi.

258
00:13:22,514 --> 00:13:25,685
Men ham yordam beraymi?

259
00:13:25,709 --> 00:13:29,842
Ha, qoʻllaringizni yuvib kelganingizdan keyin yordam bering.

260
00:13:29,865 --> 00:13:32,080
Yuvib keldim.

261
00:13:32,103 --> 00:13:36,958
Shunda tuxumni idishga solib, aralashib qoʻying.

262
00:13:36,982 --> 00:13:39,115
Bunday qilaymi?

263
00:13:39,138 --> 00:13:44,938
Ha, keyinroq shakar solib yana aralashtiramiz.

264
00:13:44,961 --> 00:13:47,228
Sut ham qo'shamanmi?

265
00:13:47,251 --> 00:13:51,451
Yo'q, sut qo'shmaymiz.

266
00:13:51,475 --> 00:13:54,213
Suv qo'shamizmi?

267
00:13:54,236 --> 00:13:58,134
Ha, ozgina suv qo'shamiz.

268
00:13:58,157 --> 00:14:00,853
Keyin nima qilamiz?

269
00:14:00,876 --> 00:14:04,410
Pechda pishirib, keyin sovutamiz.

270
00:14:04,433 --> 00:14:07,366
Necha daqiqa pishiramiz?

271
00:14:07,389 --> 00:14:10,522
Ko'rsatmaga ko'ra pishiramiz.

272
00:14:10,545 --> 00:14:13,722
U yerda o‘ttiz daqiqa deb yozilgan.

273
00:14:13,746 --> 00:14:17,146
Unda, o‘ttiz daqiqa pishiramiz.

274
00:14:17,168 --> 00:14:19,508
Qaymoq surtasizmi?

275
00:14:19,531 --> 00:14:23,582
Yo'q, qaymoq surtmay, shunday yeymiz.

276
00:14:23,606 --> 00:14:26,139
Shirin ko'rinibdi!

277
00:14:26,162 --> 00:14:29,796
Muzlatgichda sovutib, keyin yeyishni boshlaymiz.

278
00:14:29,819 --> 00:14:32,312
Kutish qiyin bo'lyapti!

279
00:14:32,336 --> 00:14:36,022
Tozalagandan keyin choy tayyorlaymiz.

280
00:14:36,045 --> 00:14:38,292
Rahmat.

281
00:14:38,316 --> 00:14:42,049
Choyga shakar solmasdan ichasizmi?

282
00:14:42,072 --> 00:14:45,272
Ha, shakar solmasdan ichaman.

283
00:14:45,295 --> 00:14:46,795
10-sahna: Sovg‘a olish / Sovg‘a qanday sotib olish kerak

284
00:14:46,795 --> 00:14:50,028
Sovg‘a sotib olmoqchiman.

285
00:14:50,051 --> 00:14:54,131
Sovg‘a bo‘lsa, ana o‘sha do‘kon yaxshi.

286
00:14:54,155 --> 00:14:56,522
Bu yerdan uzoqmi?

287
00:14:56,545 --> 00:15:00,712
Yo‘q, besh daqiqa yurib boriladi.

288
00:15:00,735 --> 00:15:03,368
Nima mazali?

289
00:15:03,391 --> 00:15:07,641
Shirinlik bo‘lsa, pechenye juda mazali.

290
00:15:07,665 --> 00:15:10,432
Narxi arzonmi?

291
00:15:10,455 --> 00:15:14,055
Arzon bo‘lsa, ko‘p sotib olasizmi?

292
00:15:14,077 --> 00:15:18,211
Ha, arzon bo‘lsa, sotib olmoqchiman.

293
00:15:18,234 --> 00:15:20,967
Ehtimol, arzon bo‘ladi deb o‘ylayman.

294
00:15:20,990 --> 00:15:25,071
Do‘konga borsak, bilib olamiz.

295
00:15:25,095 --> 00:15:29,138
Ha, tez boradigan bo‘lsak, hali ochiq bo‘ladi.

296
00:15:29,161 --> 00:15:32,628
Agar yomg‘ir yog‘sa, bormaymiz.

297
00:15:32,651 --> 00:15:35,784
Hozir yog‘mayapti.

298
00:15:35,807 --> 00:15:38,424
Ob-havo yaxshi bo‘lsa, boramiz.

299
00:15:38,447 --> 00:15:41,182
Unda, boramiz!

300
00:15:41,206 --> 00:15:44,775
Ana o‘sha do‘konda karta ishlatish mumkinmi?

301
00:15:44,799 --> 00:15:48,599
Ha, karta bilan to‘lash mumkin.

302
00:15:48,623 --> 00:15:52,640
Naqd pul bo‘lmasa, karta bilan to‘laymiz.

303
00:15:52,663 --> 00:15:54,802
Bu yaxshi fikr.

304
00:15:54,826 --> 00:15:59,492
Yo‘lni bilmasangiz, aytib qo‘yaman.

305
00:15:59,515 --> 00:16:03,049
Smartfon xaritasiga qarasak, bilib olamiz.

306
00:16:03,072 --> 00:16:05,682
Smartfon juda qulay narsa ekan.

307
00:16:05,706 --> 00:16:08,839
Qidirsak, darhol topiladi.

308
00:16:08,862 --> 00:16:12,873
Vaqt bo‘lsa, kafe ham borishni xohlayman.

309
00:16:12,897 --> 00:16:16,630
Kofe bo‘lsa, ana o‘sha yerda juda mazali.

310
00:16:16,653 --> 00:16:19,720
Erta borsak, joy topamiz.

311
00:16:19,743 --> 00:16:23,176
Ha, biroz shoshilaylik.

312
00:16:23,199 --> 00:16:25,894
Yugursak, yetib olamiz.

313
00:16:25,917 --> 00:16:29,051
Yiqilmang, iltimos!

314
00:16:29,074 --> 00:16:30,574
11-sahna: Sog‘lom odatlarni shakllantirish / Sog‘lom odatlarni o‘rganamiz

315
00:16:30,574 --> 00:16:34,540
Yaqinda sport zaliga borib turasizmi?

316
00:16:34,563 --> 00:16:38,297
Ha, ozish uchun borib turaman.

317
00:16:38,320 --> 00:16:41,453
Har kuni yugurib turasizmi?

318
00:16:41,476 --> 00:16:45,543
Ha, endi uzoqroq yugura olaman.

319
00:16:45,566 --> 00:16:47,734
Ajoyib!

320
00:16:47,757 --> 00:16:51,195
Avval hech yugura olmasdim.

321
00:16:51,219 --> 00:16:54,997
Har kuni sport qilib turasizmi?

322
00:16:55,020 --> 00:16:59,154
Ha, imkon qadar piyoda yurishga harakat qilaman.

323
00:16:59,177 --> 00:17:01,423
Ovqatlanish qanday?

324
00:17:01,446 --> 00:17:05,079
Koʻp sabzavot yeyishga harakat qilaman.

325
00:17:05,102 --> 00:17:07,869
Shirinlik yemaysizmi?

326
00:17:07,892 --> 00:17:10,892
Yemaslikka harakat qilaman.

327
00:17:10,915 --> 00:17:14,248
Men yaqinda semirib ketdim.

328
00:17:14,271 --> 00:17:17,005
Sport qilmaganingiz uchun.

329
00:17:17,028 --> 00:17:20,314
Eski kiyimlarimni kiya olmay qoldim.

330
00:17:20,338 --> 00:17:23,804
Ozroq sport qilib turing.

331
00:17:23,827 --> 00:17:26,708
Lekin vaqtim yoʻq.

332
00:17:26,731 --> 00:17:30,065
Erta turishga harakat qilsangiz boʻladi.

333
00:17:30,088 --> 00:17:33,945
Ertalab erta turishga odatlandingizmi?

334
00:17:33,968 --> 00:17:37,934
Ha, soat oltida turishga harakat qilaman.

335
00:17:37,957 --> 00:17:41,176
Unda men ham harakat qilaman.

336
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:44,478
Sport zalida suza oladigan boʻldingizmi?

337
00:17:44,501 --> 00:17:48,114
Yoʻq, hali suza olmayman.

338
00:17:48,138 --> 00:17:51,622
Toʻxtamang, mashq qilishda davom eting.

339
00:17:51,645 --> 00:17:55,379
Ha, basseynaga borishga harakat qilaman.

340
00:17:55,402 --> 00:17:58,884
Shamollamang, ehtiyot boʻling.

341
00:17:58,907 --> 00:18:01,974
Ha, ehtiyot boʻlaman.

342
00:18:01,997 --> 00:18:05,855
Men koʻp suv ichishga harakat qilaman.

343
00:18:05,878 --> 00:18:08,478
Bu ham sogʻlik uchun foydali.

344
00:18:08,501 --> 00:18:11,668
Shuning uchun sogʻligim yaxshilandi.

345
00:18:11,691 --> 00:18:13,191
12-Sahna: Eng yomon kun / A Terrible Day

346
00:18:13,191 --> 00:18:17,568
Bugun eng yomon kun boʻldi.

347
00:18:17,591 --> 00:18:19,839
Nima boʻldi?

348
00:18:19,863 --> 00:18:24,672
Ertalab toʻla poyezdda oyogʻimga bosishdi.

349
00:18:24,695 --> 00:18:27,662
Bu ogʻriq beradi-ku.

350
00:18:27,685 --> 00:18:31,565
Ha, juda ogʻridi.

351
00:18:31,589 --> 00:18:34,481
Yana nima boʻldi?

352
00:18:34,504 --> 00:18:37,537
Orqamdan itarib yuborishdi.

353
00:18:37,560 --> 00:18:39,993
Qiyin bo'lgan-ku.

354
00:18:40,016 --> 00:18:44,416
Ishda direktor menga qattiq tanbeh berdi.

355
00:18:44,439 --> 00:18:47,406
Xato qildingizmi?

356
00:18:47,429 --> 00:18:51,696
Ha, hujjatlarni xato tayyorlaganman.

357
00:18:51,719 --> 00:18:54,286
Direktor sizni chaqirdi-mi?

358
00:18:54,309 --> 00:18:57,842
Ha, xonaga chaqirdi.

359
00:18:57,865 --> 00:19:00,498
Qattiq gapirdimi?

360
00:19:00,521 --> 00:19:04,555
Ha, koʻp tanbeh berdi.

361
00:19:04,578 --> 00:19:07,460
Bu juda tushkunlikka soladi.

362
00:19:07,483 --> 00:19:11,616
Qaytishda yomgʻir yogʻdi.

363
00:19:11,639 --> 00:19:14,606
Soyabon olmagan edingizmi?

364
00:19:14,629 --> 00:19:18,162
Soyabonim oʻgʻirlab ketishdi.

365
00:19:18,185 --> 00:19:21,118
Voy, oʻgʻirlab ketishganmi?

366
00:19:21,141 --> 00:19:26,151
Ha, konbini soyabonlaridan oʻgʻirlab ketishdi.

367
00:19:26,175 --> 00:19:30,375
Bundan tashqari, telefonimni ham tushirib sindirdim.

368
00:19:30,398 --> 00:19:33,249
Kimdir bilan toʻqnashdingizmi?

369
00:19:33,272 --> 00:19:37,406
Ha, nomaʼlum odam bilan toʻqnashdim.

370
00:19:37,429 --> 00:19:41,362
Haqiqatan ham eng yomon kun boʻldi-ku.

371
00:19:41,385 --> 00:19:42,885
13-Sahna: Sportning zavqi / Sport qilish quvonchi

372
00:19:42,885 --> 00:19:46,218
Bugun ob-havo juda yaxshi ekan-ku.

373
00:19:46,241 --> 00:19:50,641
Tashqarida sport qilish juda yoqimli.

374
00:19:50,664 --> 00:19:52,231
Shunday, rostdan.

375
00:19:52,254 --> 00:19:56,821
Men tennis oʻynashni juda yaxshi koʻraman.

376
00:19:56,844 --> 00:19:59,448
Men ham.

377
00:19:59,471 --> 00:20:03,804
Dam olish kunlarida sport qilish sogʻliq uchun foydali.

378
00:20:03,827 --> 00:20:08,694
Tanaka-san, siz sport tomosha qilishni ham yaxshi koʻrasizmi?

379
00:20:08,717 --> 00:20:10,517
Ha.

380
00:20:10,540 --> 00:20:14,797
Lekin, oʻzim sport qilishni eng yaxshi koʻraman.

381
00:20:14,820 --> 00:20:20,020
Men yugurishni biroz qiyin koʻraman.

382
00:20:20,043 --> 00:20:22,443
Muammo yoʻq.

383
00:20:22,467 --> 00:20:25,600
Birgalikda zavqlanish muhim.

384
00:20:25,623 --> 00:20:28,707
Voy, muammo boʻldi!

385
00:20:28,730 --> 00:20:31,218
Nima bo'ldi?

386
00:20:31,241 --> 00:20:35,376
Tennis poyabzali olib kelishni unutibman.

387
00:20:35,400 --> 00:20:37,200
E?

388
00:20:37,223 --> 00:20:40,461
Olib kelishni unutdingizmi?

389
00:20:40,485 --> 00:20:42,136
Ha.

390
00:20:42,160 --> 00:20:45,407
Sumkamga solishni unutdim.

391
00:20:45,430 --> 00:20:49,076
Poyabzalsiz qiyin boʻladi-ku.

392
00:20:49,099 --> 00:20:54,032
Qabulxonada poyabzal ijaraga berishini bilasizmi?

393
00:20:54,055 --> 00:20:55,630
Ha.

394
00:20:55,654 --> 00:20:58,854
Ijaraga berishini bilaman.

395
00:20:58,877 --> 00:21:01,010
Yaxshi bo'ldi.

396
00:21:01,033 --> 00:21:03,930
Endi borib ijaraga olaman.

397
00:21:03,954 --> 00:21:08,588
A, bugun Suzuki-san kelishini bilasizmi?

398
00:21:08,611 --> 00:21:12,905
Yoʻq, kelishini bilmasdim.

399
00:21:12,928 --> 00:21:16,622
Tez orada shu yerga yetib keladi.

400
00:21:16,645 --> 00:21:20,533
Suzuki-san tennisda juda mohir.

401
00:21:20,556 --> 00:21:21,956
Ha.

402
00:21:21,979 --> 00:21:27,448
Bizlar orasida eng mohiri Suzuki-san.

403
00:21:27,471 --> 00:21:28,914
Shunday, rostdan.

404
00:21:28,938 --> 00:21:33,505
Birga mashq qilish biroz asabni buzar.

405
00:21:33,529 --> 00:21:38,896
Suzuki-san yangi raketka sotib olganini bilasizmi?

406
00:21:38,919 --> 00:21:42,339
Yoʻq, bilmasdim.

407
00:21:42,362 --> 00:21:47,795
Bugun u bilan oʻynashni tomosha qilishni intizorman.

408
00:21:47,818 --> 00:21:50,785
Bu juda qiziqarli boʻladi-ku.

409
00:21:50,808 --> 00:21:53,866
Tomosha qilishni kutolmayapman.

410
00:21:53,889 --> 00:21:58,668
Unda tezroq borib poyabzal ijaraga oling.

411
00:21:58,692 --> 00:22:00,325
Ha.

412
00:22:00,348 --> 00:22:04,681
Qabulxonada pul toʻlashni unutmang.

413
00:22:04,704 --> 00:22:08,602
Biz oʻynaydigan kort ana u yerda.

414
00:22:08,626 --> 00:22:10,603
Tushunarli.

415
00:22:10,627 --> 00:22:12,760
Hozir boraman.

416
00:22:12,783 --> 00:22:16,462
Shoshilib yugurish xavfli.

417
00:22:16,486 --> 00:22:18,219
Ha.

418
00:22:18,242 --> 00:22:20,642
Ehtiyot boʻlaman.

419
00:22:20,665 --> 00:22:22,165
14-Sahna: Kechikish haqida xabar va uzr / Kechikkanlik uchun uzr va muloqot

420
00:22:22,165 --> 00:22:24,565
Kechikkanim uchun uzr.

421
00:22:24,588 --> 00:22:28,040
Uzoq vaqtdan beri kutayotgan edim.

422
00:22:28,063 --> 00:22:31,711
Avtobus kelmadi, shuning uchun kechikdim.

423
00:22:31,734 --> 00:22:34,301
Baxtsiz hodisa boʻlganmi?

424
00:22:34,324 --> 00:22:38,857
Yoʻl tirband edi, hech qanday harakat yoʻq edi.

425
00:22:38,880 --> 00:22:42,280
Xavotirdan qoʻlingizga qoʻngʻiroq qildim.

426
00:22:42,303 --> 00:22:47,472
Telefonimning batareyasi tugab qoldi, shuning uchun javob bera olmadim.

427
00:22:47,496 --> 00:22:50,463
Bu muammo boʻldi-ku.

428
00:22:50,486 --> 00:22:53,943
Ha, juda tashvishlandim.

429
00:22:53,966 --> 00:22:58,703
Sizdan xabar boʻlmadi, shuning uchun biroz jahlim chiqdi.

430
00:22:58,727 --> 00:23:01,760
Rostdan kechirasiz.

431
00:23:01,783 --> 00:23:05,229
Charchadim, biroz dam olamiz.

432
00:23:05,253 --> 00:23:09,147
Ana oʻsha kafe boʻsh, kiramiz.

433
00:23:09,170 --> 00:23:11,857
Qahva ichmoqchiman.

434
00:23:11,881 --> 00:23:16,315
Men toʻlayman, shuning uchun sevimli narsangizni buyurtma qiling.

435
00:23:16,338 --> 00:23:18,271
Rostdan ham yaxshimi?

436
00:23:18,294 --> 00:23:21,542
Kechikdim, shuning uchun sizga sovgʻa qilaman.

437
00:23:21,565 --> 00:23:24,740
Unda, minnatdorchilik bilan qabul qilaman.

438
00:23:24,763 --> 00:23:29,297
Tashqarisi sovuq edi, shuning uchun iliq narsa yaxshi boʻlardi.

439
00:23:29,319 --> 00:23:33,453
Birdan yomgʻir yogʻa boshladi, sovuq.

440
00:23:33,477 --> 00:23:37,371
Men hoʻl boʻlmaganim uchun yaxshi boʻldi.

441
00:23:37,395 --> 00:23:41,399
Men ham soyabon olib yurganim uchun yaxshi boʻldi.

442
00:23:41,423 --> 00:23:44,223
Kinoning vaqti yaxshimi?

443
00:23:44,246 --> 00:23:48,179
Vaqti oʻtib ketdi, endi koʻrolmaymiz.

444
00:23:48,202 --> 00:23:50,645
Rostdan uzr.

445
00:23:50,669 --> 00:23:54,302
Keyingi seans bor, muammo yoʻq.

446
00:23:54,325 --> 00:23:56,302
Yengil nafas oldim.

447
00:23:56,325 --> 00:23:59,892
Vaqti bor, shuning uchun sekinroq qilamiz.

448
00:23:59,915 --> 00:24:01,648
Shunday, rostdan.

449
00:24:01,671 --> 00:24:06,005
Endi jahlim chiqmadi, xavotir olmang.

450
00:24:06,028 --> 00:24:07,528
15-SAHNA: Achchiqlikni sinab koʻrish

451
00:24:07,528 --> 00:24:11,217
Bu taom mazali ekanmi?

452
00:24:11,240 --> 00:24:16,313
Mazali yoki yoʻqligini bilish uchun avval tatib koʻraman.

453
00:24:16,336 --> 00:24:19,376
Koʻrinishidan achchiqdek.

454
00:24:19,400 --> 00:24:24,053
Qanchalik achchiq ekanligini ofitsiantdan soʻraymiz.

455
00:24:24,077 --> 00:24:28,564
Ofitsiant biroz achchiq ekanligini aytdi.

456
00:24:28,588 --> 00:24:33,154
Biz buni yey olishimiz yoki yoʻqligini bilmaymiz.

457
00:24:33,177 --> 00:24:36,511
Unda, biroz tatib koʻraman.

458
00:24:36,534 --> 00:24:38,312
Qanday?

459
00:24:38,335 --> 00:24:41,193
Juda achchiq.

460
00:24:41,216 --> 00:24:43,787
Suv ichib koʻrasizmi?

461
00:24:43,811 --> 00:24:46,780
Ha, ichib koʻraman.

462
00:24:46,803 --> 00:24:48,677
Yaxshimisiz?

463
00:24:48,701 --> 00:24:53,381
Achchiq, lekin yana bir tishlamani tatib koʻraman.

464
00:24:53,404 --> 00:24:55,873
Achchiq narsalarni yoqtirasizmi?

465
00:24:55,896 --> 00:25:00,663
Oʻzim ham yoqtiraman yoki yoʻqligimni bilmayman.

466
00:25:00,686 --> 00:25:03,519
Terlagansiz-ku.

467
00:25:03,542 --> 00:25:07,792
Juda achchiq, hatto issiq yoki sovuq ekanligini ham bilmayapman.

468
00:25:07,816 --> 00:25:10,624
Zoʻrlamang.

469
00:25:10,647 --> 00:25:15,825
Aytib turing, bu goʻsht qaysi hayvon goʻshti ekanligini bilasizmi?

470
00:25:15,849 --> 00:25:20,082
Choʻchqa goʻshti yoki yoʻqligini ofitsiantdan soʻraymizmi?

471
00:25:20,105 --> 00:25:24,238
Taʼmi tovuq goʻshtiga oʻxshaydi.

472
00:25:24,261 --> 00:25:27,742
Menyuda yozilganini koʻrib chiqamizmi?

473
00:25:27,766 --> 00:25:31,333
Bu yerda yozilmagan.

474
00:25:31,356 --> 00:25:35,489
Mazali ekan, qaysi goʻsht ekanligi muhim emas.

475
00:25:35,512 --> 00:25:38,479
Desert ham buyurtma qilamizmi?

476
00:25:38,502 --> 00:25:42,168
Shirin yoki yoʻqligini bilish qiziq.

477
00:25:42,191 --> 00:25:45,161
Bu pirogni tatib koʻraman.

478
00:25:45,185 --> 00:25:47,952
Qanchadir turishini bilasizmi?

479
00:25:47,975 --> 00:25:51,208
Menyudan narxini koʻrayapman.

480
00:25:51,231 --> 00:25:53,898
Qimmat boʻlmasa yaxshi boʻlardi.

481
00:25:53,921 --> 00:25:55,421
16-Sahna: Hurmatli soʻzlardan foydalanish / Hurmatli tilning toʻgʻri ishlatilishi

482
00:25:55,421 --> 00:25:58,354
Bu qandolatlar juda chiroyli ekan!

483
00:25:58,377 --> 00:26:03,062
Ha, mijozlarimizdan sovgʻa oldim.

484
00:26:03,086 --> 00:26:06,173
Bu mashhur doʻkonning qandolatlarimi?

485
00:26:06,197 --> 00:26:10,397
Ha, direktorimiz sotib kelishdi.

486
00:26:10,420 --> 00:26:13,253
Ajoyib!

487
00:26:13,276 --> 00:26:17,156
Ha, juda xursand boʻldim.

488
00:26:17,180 --> 00:26:20,746
Men ham bitta olsam boʻlmaydimi?

489
00:26:20,769 --> 00:26:23,703
Albatta, iltimos.

490
00:26:23,726 --> 00:26:25,692
Rahmat.

491
00:26:25,715 --> 00:26:27,649
Omad.

492
00:26:27,672 --> 00:26:30,145
Taʼmi qanday?

493
00:26:30,168 --> 00:26:32,968
Juda mazali!

494
00:26:32,991 --> 00:26:38,158
Aytgancha, boʻlim boshligʻingizga choy quyib berolmaysizmi?

495
00:26:38,180 --> 00:26:41,260
Ha, choy quyib beraman.

496
00:26:41,284 --> 00:26:46,729
Boʻlim boshligʻingizga nisbatan 'beraman' degan soʻz notoʻgʻri.

497
00:26:46,752 --> 00:26:49,018
A, shunday ekan.

498
00:26:49,041 --> 00:26:50,522
Kechirasiz.

499
00:26:50,546 --> 00:26:54,319
Choy quyib, taqdim qilib qoʻying.

500
00:26:54,342 --> 00:26:56,675
Ha, tushundim.

501
00:26:56,698 --> 00:27:01,498
Ertalab uy hayvoningizga ovqat berdingizmi?

502
00:27:01,521 --> 00:27:04,888
Ha, ketishdan oldin berdim.

503
00:27:04,911 --> 00:27:10,477
Unda, ofisdagi oʻsimliklarga ham suv quyib qoʻysangiz boʻlmaydimi?

504
00:27:10,500 --> 00:27:13,500
Ha, hozir quyaman.

505
00:27:13,523 --> 00:27:17,857
Aytgancha, katta akam kitob berdi.

506
00:27:17,880 --> 00:27:20,046
Qanday kitob?

507
00:27:20,069 --> 00:27:24,128
Juda yaxshi kitob ekanligini aytishdi.

508
00:27:24,151 --> 00:27:28,218
Keyinroq muqovasi suratini olib berolmaysizmi?

509
00:27:28,241 --> 00:27:31,610
Ha, suratini olib yuboraman.

510
00:27:31,634 --> 00:27:33,634
Rahmat.

511
00:27:33,657 --> 00:27:38,132
Ertangi yigʻilish uchun tayyorgarlikda yordam berolmaysizmi?

512
00:27:38,156 --> 00:27:42,325
Ha, mamnuniyat bilan yordam beraman.

513
00:27:42,348 --> 00:27:44,836
Juda yordam berasiz.

514
00:27:44,860 --> 00:27:46,360
17-Sahna: Tejamkorlik va koʻchish uchun tayyorgarlik / Pul tejash va koʻchishga tayyorgarlik

515
00:27:46,360 --> 00:27:51,093
Har kuni yarim kunlik ish qilasizku.

516
00:27:51,116 --> 00:27:55,349
Ha, uy sotib olish uchun pul yigʻyapman.

517
00:27:55,372 --> 00:27:59,306
Uy sotib olish uchun qancha kerak boʻladi?

518
00:27:59,329 --> 00:28:02,495
Juda koʻp pul kerak boʻladi.

519
00:28:02,518 --> 00:28:06,885
Oilangiz uchun ishlashingiz juda yaxshi.

520
00:28:06,908 --> 00:28:11,397
Oilam bilan sayohatga chiqish uchun ham pul yigʻyapman.

521
00:28:11,421 --> 00:28:14,554
Qayerga sayohat qilish uchun?

522
00:28:14,577 --> 00:28:17,510
Gavayiga borish uchun.

523
00:28:17,533 --> 00:28:22,200
Aytgancha, bu qaychi nima uchun kerak?

524
00:28:22,223 --> 00:28:27,310
Bu koʻchish uchun qutilarni kesish uchun ishlatiladi.

525
00:28:27,333 --> 00:28:31,424
Bu katta quti nima uchun?

526
00:28:31,448 --> 00:28:35,497
Qimmatbaho narsalarni joylashtirish uchun.

527
00:28:35,520 --> 00:28:39,404
Koʻchish uchun bir nechta kerak boʻladi-ku.

528
00:28:39,427 --> 00:28:43,761
Ha, kiyimlarni tashishda ham qulay.

529
00:28:43,784 --> 00:28:49,263
Yangi uyidan ofisga qanchalik vaqt ketadi?

530
00:28:49,286 --> 00:28:52,486
Poyezdda bir soat ketadi.

531
00:28:52,509 --> 00:28:56,076
Har kuni borish uchun uzoq ekan.

532
00:28:56,099 --> 00:29:01,510
Ha, lekin poyezdda kitob o‘qishga juda qulay.

533
00:29:01,533 --> 00:29:05,867
Yapon tilini o‘rganish uchun kitob sotib oldingiz-ku?

534
00:29:05,890 --> 00:29:10,890
Ha, lekin lug‘atga qarash uchun vaqt ketadi.

535
00:29:10,913 --> 00:29:15,313
Boshida izlash uchun vaqt ketadi-ku.

536
00:29:15,336 --> 00:29:20,069
Yaqinda sog‘lik uchun sport ham qila boshladim.

537
00:29:20,092 --> 00:29:24,959
A, yugurish uchun yangi poyabzal oldingiz-ku?

538
00:29:24,982 --> 00:29:29,715
Ha, sport qilish uchun juda yaxshi poyabzal.

539
00:29:29,738 --> 00:29:34,705
Men vazn tushirish uchun kamroq ovqatlanaman.

540
00:29:34,728 --> 00:29:37,261
Bunday qilish yaxshi emas-ku.

541
00:29:37,284 --> 00:29:40,559
Sog‘lom yashash uchun ovqatlang-ku.

542
00:29:40,582 --> 00:29:43,982
Ha, e’tibor beraman.

543
00:29:44,005 --> 00:29:48,461
Inson uxlash uchun ham energiya sarflaydi-ku.

544
00:29:48,484 --> 00:29:53,318
Unda, ertaga yana kuchga kirish uchun yaxshi uxlayman.

545
00:29:53,341 --> 00:29:56,542
Ha, yaxshi dam oling.

546
00:29:56,565 --> 00:29:58,809
Xayr, yaxshi tun.

547
00:29:58,833 --> 00:30:00,333
18-Sahna: Bo‘ron oldidan tayyorgarlik / Bo‘ron yaqinlashmoqda

548
00:30:00,333 --> 00:30:04,566
Osmon qorayib qoldi-ku.

549
00:30:04,589 --> 00:30:07,889
Ha, hozir-yoqinda yomg‘ir yog‘ishi mumkin.

550
00:30:07,912 --> 00:30:11,124
Shamol ham kuchli esayapti.

551
00:30:11,148 --> 00:30:13,601
Bo‘ron bo‘lishi mumkin.

552
00:30:13,624 --> 00:30:17,998
Tezroq binoga kirsak yaxshi bo‘ladi.

553
00:30:18,021 --> 00:30:21,662
Unda, tashqaridagi narsalarni yig‘ib olaman.

554
00:30:21,685 --> 00:30:25,255
Shamol soyabonni sindirib yuborishi mumkin.

555
00:30:25,279 --> 00:30:28,412
Haqiqatan ham kuchli shamol ekan.

556
00:30:28,435 --> 00:30:31,869
Birdan sovuq tusha boshladi.

557
00:30:31,893 --> 00:30:35,093
Bunday havoda shamollab qolish mumkin.

558
00:30:35,116 --> 00:30:39,524
U yerda issiq choy sotib olib kelaman.

559
00:30:39,547 --> 00:30:41,218
Iltimos.

560
00:30:41,242 --> 00:30:43,242
Sotib oldim.

561
00:30:43,265 --> 00:30:46,633
Bu choy juda issiqdek.

562
00:30:46,656 --> 00:30:49,623
Tutganda e’tiborli bo‘ling.

563
00:30:49,646 --> 00:30:53,447
Ha, ozgina ichib ko‘ray.

564
00:30:53,470 --> 00:30:56,804
Issiq va mazali ko‘rinadi.

565
00:30:56,827 --> 00:31:00,118
Ha, juda mazali.

566
00:31:00,141 --> 00:31:03,875
A, osmon yorug‘ tusha boshladi.

567
00:31:03,898 --> 00:31:07,031
Yomg‘ir to‘xtab qoldi-ku.

568
00:31:07,054 --> 00:31:10,465
Ha, ob-havo ochilib qoldi.

569
00:31:10,488 --> 00:31:13,724
Rostdan ham yaxshi bo‘ldi.

570
00:31:13,748 --> 00:31:16,604
Ana u yerda kamalak chiqishi mumkin.

571
00:31:16,628 --> 00:31:19,707
Tashqariga chiqib ko‘ray.

572
00:31:19,730 --> 00:31:22,530
Chiroyli kamalak ko‘rinadimi?

573
00:31:22,553 --> 00:31:26,687
Yo‘q, hali aniq ko‘rinmayapti.

574
00:31:26,710 --> 00:31:31,148
Xavfsiz bo‘lganimdan keyin qorni ochib qoldi.

575
00:31:31,171 --> 00:31:35,174
Qorni ochib, yig‘lamoqchi bo‘layotgan yuzingiz-ku.

576
00:31:35,198 --> 00:31:38,237
Yaqin joyda ovqatlanib kelaman.

577
00:31:38,260 --> 00:31:40,718
Borib keling.

578
00:31:40,742 --> 00:31:43,076
Tez orada qaytaman.

579
00:31:43,099 --> 00:31:44,599
19-Sahna: Ko‘p ovqatlanish va poyabzal muammolari / Ko‘p ovqatlanish va poyabzal muammolari

580
00:31:44,599 --> 00:31:48,599
Tushlikda biroz ko‘p ovqatlandim.

581
00:31:48,622 --> 00:31:52,588
Bufetda bexosdan ko‘p ovqatlanib qo‘yiladi-ku.

582
00:31:52,611 --> 00:31:57,219
Ko‘p ovqatlanib, qorni og‘rib qoldi.

583
00:31:57,242 --> 00:32:00,609
Sovuq sharbatni ham ko‘p ichib qo‘ydingizmi?

584
00:32:00,632 --> 00:32:05,499
Ha, uch stakan ichdim, ortiqcha bo‘lib qoldi.

585
00:32:05,522 --> 00:32:09,331
Oxirgi pirog ham juda shirin edi, shunday emasmi?

586
00:32:09,355 --> 00:32:14,557
Bundan tashqari, bugun kiyib kelgan poyabzalim yurishga noqulay ekan.

587
00:32:14,580 --> 00:32:17,713
O‘lchami juda kichikmi?

588
00:32:17,736 --> 00:32:21,775
Yo‘q, poshnasi juda baland ekan.

589
00:32:21,799 --> 00:32:25,799
Zo‘rlamang, ko‘chish uchun taksiga o‘tirishga qaramasmi?

590
00:32:25,822 --> 00:32:30,876
Ha, yurish charchaganligi uchun taksiga o‘tiraman.

591
00:32:30,899 --> 00:32:33,710
Qalamlar do‘koniga yetib keldik-ku!

592
00:32:33,734 --> 00:32:36,934
Bu ruchka yozishga juda qulay ekan.

593
00:32:36,957 --> 00:32:41,157
Rostdan ham! Narxi ham juda arzon.

594
00:32:41,180 --> 00:32:44,799
Yengil va foydalanish uchun juda qulay.

595
00:32:44,823 --> 00:32:48,438
Unda, men bu qizil ruchkani olaman.

596
00:32:48,461 --> 00:32:51,296
Men esa kitob sotib olaman.

597
00:32:51,319 --> 00:32:55,653
Ammo bu kitob tushunishga qiyin ekan-ku.

598
00:32:55,676 --> 00:32:59,492
Rostdan ham, kanji belgilari juda ko‘p.

599
00:32:59,515 --> 00:33:03,091
Menga o‘qish juda qiyin.

600
00:33:03,115 --> 00:33:06,448
Unda, yanada osonroq kitobga o‘tsakmi?

601
00:33:06,471 --> 00:33:09,438
Ha, shu yaxshi bo‘ladi.

602
00:33:09,461 --> 00:33:14,227
Bu kafe o‘rinlari biroz qorong‘i ekan-ku.

603
00:33:14,250 --> 00:33:17,250
Kitobdagi yozuvlar ko‘rinmayapti.

604
00:33:17,273 --> 00:33:20,673
Stenddagi chiroqni yoqishga qaraymiz.

605
00:33:20,696 --> 00:33:23,904
Vay, bu juda yorug‘ bo‘lib qoldi!

606
00:33:23,928 --> 00:33:27,339
Unda, biroz xiraroq qilaman.

607
00:33:27,362 --> 00:33:29,995
Ha, endi to‘g‘ri.

608
00:33:30,018 --> 00:33:33,985
Kafedagi musiqa juda shovqinli emasmi?

609
00:33:34,008 --> 00:33:37,680
Yo‘q, tinch va eshitishga qulay.

610
00:33:37,704 --> 00:33:40,377
Unda, shu o‘ringa o‘tiramiz.

611
00:33:40,400 --> 00:33:42,933
Ha, rozi.

612
00:33:42,956 --> 00:33:44,456
20-SAHNA: Qaytarish muammolari / Qaytarish va pulni qaytarish masalalari

613
00:33:44,456 --> 00:33:48,623
Internetda sotib olgan yukim yetib keldi.

614
00:33:48,646 --> 00:33:51,312
Tezda ochib ko‘raylik.

615
00:33:51,335 --> 00:33:55,469
A, qismlari singan ekan.

616
00:33:55,492 --> 00:33:59,225
Qimmat pul to‘laganimga qaramay.

617
00:33:59,248 --> 00:34:03,386
Kutib turganimga qaramay, afsus.

618
00:34:03,410 --> 00:34:07,843
Dastlabdan singan bo‘lsa, nima qilamiz?

619
00:34:07,866 --> 00:34:11,722
Dokonga qaytarish mumkin bo‘lishi kerak.

620
00:34:11,746 --> 00:34:15,642
Ayni paytda qo‘ng‘iroq qildim, lekin javob bermayapti.

621
00:34:15,666 --> 00:34:20,799
Dokon dam olish kuni emas-ku, g‘alati.

622
00:34:20,822 --> 00:34:26,189
Telefon orqali bog‘lanib bo‘lmasa, elektron pochta orqali yozamiz.

623
00:34:26,212 --> 00:34:30,812
Elektron pochtaga yozdim, lekin hali javob kelmadi.

624
00:34:30,835 --> 00:34:35,891
Javob kechikayotgan bo‘lsa, biroz kutib turamiz.

625
00:34:35,915 --> 00:34:40,448
Yetib kelguniga bir hafta kutganimga qaramay.

626
00:34:40,471 --> 00:34:44,679
Agar shoshilayotgan bo‘lsangiz, bekor qilamizmi?

627
00:34:44,703 --> 00:34:49,138
Ko‘p vaqt davomida xohlaganimga qaramay, voz kechaman.

628
00:34:49,162 --> 00:34:55,562
Yangi mahsulot yuborilsa ham, o‘lchami mos kelmasligi mumkin.

629
00:34:55,585 --> 00:35:00,427
Xonadan ham kattaroq bo‘lsa, muammo bo‘ladi.

630
00:35:00,450 --> 00:35:06,017
O‘zim tuzatishga harakat qilib, yo‘riqnomani o‘qidim, lekin tushunmadim.

631
00:35:06,040 --> 00:35:10,510
Tushunmasangiz, men o‘qib beraman.

632
00:35:10,533 --> 00:35:15,616
Yapon tilini o‘rganganimga qaramay, bu kanji belgisini o‘qiy olmayapman.

633
00:35:15,639 --> 00:35:20,378
Oʻqiy olmasangiz, smartfoningizdagi lugʻatdan foydalaning.

634
00:35:20,402 --> 00:35:25,569
Birga tuzatishni vaʼda qilgan edik, lekin doʻstim kelmadi.

635
00:35:25,592 --> 00:35:31,795
Doʻstim kelmasa, ikkimizgina tuzatamizmi?

636
00:35:31,818 --> 00:35:37,427
Men shunchalik xafa boʻldim, siz esa kulayapsiz.

637
00:35:37,451 --> 00:35:41,684
Yigʻlamoqchi boʻlsangiz, yigʻlashingiz mumkin.

638
00:35:41,707 --> 00:35:47,907
Kayfiyatni oʻzgartirish uchun chiqmoqchiman, lekin yomgʻir yogʻyapti, soyabonim esa yoʻq.

639
00:35:47,930 --> 00:35:53,174
Hoʻl boʻlsa, uyga qaytib, kiyimlarni almashtiraman.

640
00:35:53,197 --> 00:35:57,444
Bugun charchadim, lekin shokdan uxlay olmayapman.

641
00:35:57,468 --> 00:36:03,468
Uxlay olmasangiz, iliq choy ichasizmi?

642
00:36:03,491 --> 00:36:06,092
Ha, shunday qilamiz.

643
00:36:06,116 --> 00:36:07,616
21-SAHNA: Uchrashuv va qoʻngʻiroqlar / Telefon qoʻngʻiroqlari va uchrashuvni muvofiqlashtirish

644
00:36:07,616 --> 00:36:10,783
Allo, hozir qayerdasiz?

645
00:36:10,806 --> 00:36:15,610
Hozir uchrashish joyi boʻlgan stansiyaga yetib keldim.

646
00:36:15,633 --> 00:36:20,087
Kechirasiz, men hozirgina shoshilib uydan chiqdim.

647
00:36:20,111 --> 00:36:23,544
Unda, hali yetib kelmagan boʻlishingiz kerak.

648
00:36:23,567 --> 00:36:27,534
Ha, yana oʻn daqiqa kerak boʻladi.

649
00:36:27,557 --> 00:36:31,490
Men stansiya oldida kutib turibman.

650
00:36:31,513 --> 00:36:36,080
Rostdan kechirasiz, hozir yugurib kelayapman.

651
00:36:36,103 --> 00:36:40,877
Kechikayotganingiz uchun xavotirda edim, shuning uchun endigina qoʻngʻiroq qildim.

652
00:36:40,900 --> 00:36:44,300
Hozirgina elektr poyezdiga chiqdim.

653
00:36:44,323 --> 00:36:48,656
Tezkor poyezd boʻlsa, keyingi stansiyada tushishingiz kerak.

654
00:36:48,679 --> 00:36:51,479
Ha, tez orada yetib kelaman.

655
00:36:51,502 --> 00:36:55,336
Aytgancha, tushlik qildingizmi?

656
00:36:55,359 --> 00:36:59,192
Ha, chiqishdan oldin ovqatlandim.

657
00:36:59,215 --> 00:37:02,986
Unda, qorni och boʻlishingiz kerak emas.

658
00:37:03,009 --> 00:37:05,976
Ha, qorni toq.

659
00:37:05,999 --> 00:37:09,565
Men hozir ovqatlanmoqchiman.

660
00:37:09,588 --> 00:37:13,841
Aytgancha, ertalabki yigʻilish tugadi mi?

661
00:37:13,865 --> 00:37:17,632
Ha, hozirgina tugadi.

662
00:37:17,655 --> 00:37:20,422
Boʻlim boshligʻi jahli chiqqanmi?

663
00:37:20,445 --> 00:37:23,941
Yoʻq, jahli chiqmasligi kerak.

664
00:37:23,964 --> 00:37:28,431
Lekin men endigina telefon orqali tanbeh oldim.

665
00:37:28,454 --> 00:37:31,888
Shundaymi, kechikkaningiz uchunmi?

666
00:37:31,911 --> 00:37:36,445
Ofisga yetib kelgach, uzr soʻrash uchun boraman.

667
00:37:36,468 --> 00:37:40,547
Samimiy uzr soʻrasangiz, muammo boʻlmasligi kerak.

668
00:37:40,570 --> 00:37:42,203
Harakat qilaman.

669
00:37:42,226 --> 00:37:45,797
Menga topshirilgan hujjatlarni hozirgina tayyorladim.

670
00:37:45,821 --> 00:37:49,191
Unda, xatolik boʻlmasligi kerak.

671
00:37:49,215 --> 00:37:53,348
Hozir smartfonimda maʼlumotlarni koʻrib turibman.

672
00:37:53,371 --> 00:37:55,470
Mukammal boʻlishi kerak.

673
00:37:55,494 --> 00:37:58,294
Ha, muammo yoʻq.

674
00:37:58,317 --> 00:38:00,521
Shoshilib keling.

675
00:38:00,544 --> 00:38:02,044
22-SAHNA: Tanakasaning toʻy tayyorlashlari / Tanakaning toʻyi uchun tayyorliklar

676
00:38:02,044 --> 00:38:07,286
Tanakasan keyingi oy turmush quradi ekan.

677
00:38:07,310 --> 00:38:09,000
Rostdanmi?

678
00:38:09,024 --> 00:38:12,157
Juda baxtli koʻrinadi.

679
00:38:12,180 --> 00:38:13,747
Ha.

680
00:38:13,770 --> 00:38:17,770
Jufti juda chiroyli ekan.

681
00:38:17,793 --> 00:38:21,959
Turmush qurganidan keyin kompaniyani tark etadi desalar.

682
00:38:21,982 --> 00:38:25,422
Yoʻq, tark etmaydi ekan.

683
00:38:25,446 --> 00:38:27,694
Bu yaxshi boʻldi.

684
00:38:27,718 --> 00:38:32,991
Lekin yaqinda toʻy tayyorlashlari uchun juda band ekan.

685
00:38:33,014 --> 00:38:34,589
Ha.

686
00:38:34,613 --> 00:38:38,080
Har kun tayyorlash qiyin ekan.

687
00:38:38,103 --> 00:38:42,282
Dam olish kunlarida ziyofat qilishni rejalashtirishgan ekan.

688
00:38:42,305 --> 00:38:45,116
Biz ham chaqirilganmizdek.

689
00:38:45,140 --> 00:38:49,540
Yoʻq, biz chaqirilmaganmizdek.

690
00:38:49,563 --> 00:38:52,238
Bir oz yolgʻizlik his qilinadi, shunday emasmi?

691
00:38:52,261 --> 00:38:55,294
Faqat oila aʼzolari bilan qilishni rejalashtirishgan ekan.

692
00:38:55,317 --> 00:38:57,207
Anladim.

693
00:38:57,231 --> 00:39:01,600
Boʻlim boshligʻi nikoh haqida bilishiga oʻxshaydi.

694
00:39:01,624 --> 00:39:03,190
Ha.

695
00:39:03,213 --> 00:39:06,347
U allaqachon tabriklik sovgʻasini bergan ekan.

696
00:39:06,369 --> 00:39:09,736
Biz ham biror narsa beramiz.

697
00:39:09,759 --> 00:39:11,726
Yaxshi ekan!

698
00:39:11,749 --> 00:39:16,824
Aytgancha, ertadan boshlab yomgʻir yogʻishi aytishgan.

699
00:39:16,847 --> 00:39:20,913
Ha, ob-havo anchagina yomon boʻlishiga oʻxshaydi.

700
00:39:20,936 --> 00:39:24,870
Dam olish kunlari yanada sovuq boʻlishi aytishgan.

701
00:39:24,893 --> 00:39:29,026
Tanaka-san hozir shamollaganga oʻxshaydi.

702
00:39:29,049 --> 00:39:33,049
Ha, u yaqinda dori ichgan ekan.

703
00:39:33,072 --> 00:39:37,530
Zoʻr bermang, tezroq dam olgan maʼqul.

704
00:39:37,553 --> 00:39:41,320
Peshindan keyin kasalxonaga borgan ekan.

705
00:39:41,343 --> 00:39:45,635
Tekshiruv natijasida ogʻir kasallik emas ekan.

706
00:39:45,659 --> 00:39:49,792
Sherigi ham xotirjam boʻlgan ekan.

707
00:39:49,815 --> 00:39:52,020
Rostdan ham yaxshi bo‘ldi.

708
00:39:52,043 --> 00:39:53,543
23-Sahna: Kutilmagan ishlarni hal etish / Tezkor shaxsiy ishlarni hal etish

709
00:39:53,543 --> 00:39:56,544
Boʻlim boshligʻi, kechirasiz.

710
00:39:56,567 --> 00:39:58,413
Nima boʻldi?

711
00:39:58,437 --> 00:40:02,704
Bugun erta ketishga ruxsat bersangiz?

712
00:40:02,727 --> 00:40:05,327
Nima boʻlgan?

713
00:40:05,350 --> 00:40:08,916
Bolam birdan isitma chiqardi.

714
00:40:08,939 --> 00:40:11,824
Bu juda qiyin ekan.

715
00:40:11,848 --> 00:40:16,681
Endi uyga qaytib, bolani kasalxonaga olib boraman.

716
00:40:16,704 --> 00:40:19,671
Tezroq ketib bering.

717
00:40:19,694 --> 00:40:21,393
Rahmat.

718
00:40:21,417 --> 00:40:25,350
Sizning ishlaringizni boshqalarga topshiraman.

719
00:40:25,373 --> 00:40:30,663
Yamada-sanga mening ishlarimda yordam berishini soʻrasam boʻladi mi?

720
00:40:30,686 --> 00:40:33,970
Ha, unga topshiramiz.

721
00:40:33,994 --> 00:40:37,802
Ertaga ham ishga kelmaslikka ruxsat bersangiz?

722
00:40:37,826 --> 00:40:40,099
Ertaga hammi?

723
00:40:40,123 --> 00:40:46,123
Xotinim ishdan chiqa olmaydi, shuning uchun men uni ishga yubormoqchiman.

724
00:40:46,146 --> 00:40:48,112
Tushunarli.

725
00:40:48,135 --> 00:40:51,135
Ertaga sizga dam olish kunini beramiz.

726
00:40:51,158 --> 00:40:53,492
Kechirasiz.

727
00:40:53,515 --> 00:40:58,198
Yoʻq, avvalo bolangizni yaxshi dam oldiring.

728
00:40:58,221 --> 00:41:02,702
Uyga qaytib, darhol dori ichiraman.

729
00:41:02,725 --> 00:41:06,259
Bolangizga zoʻr bermang.

730
00:41:06,282 --> 00:41:10,215
Ha, bugun uni erta uxlataman.

731
00:41:10,238 --> 00:41:14,005
Ertalab yana xabar kutaman.

732
00:41:14,028 --> 00:41:18,322
Keyinroq vaziyatni telefon orqali xabar beraman.

733
00:41:18,345 --> 00:41:22,756
Yoʻq, qiyin boʻlsa, xat orqali yetarli.

734
00:41:22,780 --> 00:41:27,355
Bir oz ishni uyga olib ketishga ruxsat bersangiz?

735
00:41:27,378 --> 00:41:31,219
Yoʻq, bugun ishlamang.

736
00:41:31,242 --> 00:41:34,097
Rahmat, chin chin.

737
00:41:34,120 --> 00:41:37,087
Ehtiyot boʻling.

738
00:41:37,110 --> 00:41:39,080
Kechirasiz.

739
00:41:39,103 --> 00:41:41,074
Tezroq sogʻayib keting.

740
00:41:41,097 --> 00:41:42,597
24-Sahna: Hurmat soʻzlarining ishlatilishi / Yapon hurmat soʻzlarini ishlatish usuli

741
00:41:42,597 --> 00:41:47,031
Prezident allaqachon ofisga kelganmi?

742
00:41:47,054 --> 00:41:50,621
Ha, hozir keldilar.

743
00:41:50,644 --> 00:41:54,377
Hozir qayerdasiz?

744
00:41:54,400 --> 00:41:58,093
Konferentsiya zalidasiz.

745
00:41:58,117 --> 00:42:02,717
Bugungi materiallarni allaqachon o‘qib chiqdingizmi?

746
00:42:02,740 --> 00:42:06,940
Ha, allaqachon o‘qib chiqdim.

747
00:42:06,963 --> 00:42:10,129
Nima deyishdi?

748
00:42:10,152 --> 00:42:13,795
Ajoyib kontent ekanligini aytishdi.

749
00:42:13,819 --> 00:42:16,464
Bu yaxshi boʻldi.

750
00:42:16,487 --> 00:42:21,921
Aytgancha, direktor golf o‘ynashni yaxshi ko‘rarlarmi?

751
00:42:21,944 --> 00:42:26,582
Ha, dam olish kunlarida tez-tez golf o‘ynashadi.

752
00:42:26,605 --> 00:42:30,239
Ertangi dam olish kunida ham golfga boradilarmi?

753
00:42:30,262 --> 00:42:34,428
Yo‘q, ertaga dam olishadi.

754
00:42:34,451 --> 00:42:37,885
Yaqinda bir oz charchagan ko‘rinisiz.

755
00:42:37,908 --> 00:42:42,752
Ha, ertaga uyda dam olishadi.

756
00:42:42,776 --> 00:42:47,469
Aytgancha, direktor bu shirinlikni yeydilarmi?

757
00:42:47,492 --> 00:42:51,226
Ha, mamnuniyat bilan yeydilar.

758
00:42:51,249 --> 00:42:54,782
Choy ham ichadilarmi?

759
00:42:54,805 --> 00:42:59,172
Yo‘q, odatda kofe ichadilar.

760
00:42:59,195 --> 00:43:02,090
Tushunarli. Tayyorlayman.

761
00:43:02,113 --> 00:43:06,363
Bo‘lim boshlig‘i ham hozir konferentsiya zalida mi?

762
00:43:06,386 --> 00:43:10,474
Yo‘q, bo‘lim boshlig‘i xizmat safariga ketdi.

763
00:43:10,497 --> 00:43:13,867
Qachon qaytadilar?

764
00:43:13,891 --> 00:43:17,326
Ertangi kechqurun qaytadilar.

765
00:43:17,350 --> 00:43:22,116
Xizmat safariga ketishdan oldin direktor bilan salomlashdilarmi?

766
00:43:22,139 --> 00:43:25,776
Ha, bugun ertalab salomlashdilar.

767
00:43:25,800 --> 00:43:29,633
A, mehmon keldi.

768
00:43:29,656 --> 00:43:33,889
Unda, kutish zaliga olib boring.

769
00:43:33,912 --> 00:43:36,312
Ma'lum bo‘ldi.

770
00:43:36,335 --> 00:43:39,310
Direktor ichkarida kutmoqda.

771
00:43:39,334 --> 00:43:40,834
25-Sahna: Salomlashish va Loyiha Taqdimoti

772
00:43:40,834 --> 00:43:44,846
Salom, tanishganimizdan xursandman.

773
00:43:44,869 --> 00:43:48,069
Men ham, siz bilan tanishganimdan xursandman.

774
00:43:48,092 --> 00:43:54,532
Bugun yangi loyiha haqida men sizga tushuntirib beraman.

775
00:43:54,555 --> 00:43:57,189
Ha, iltimos.

776
00:43:57,212 --> 00:44:00,849
Oldindan yuborilgan materiallarni ko‘rib chiqdim.

777
00:44:00,872 --> 00:44:02,769
Rahmat.

778
00:44:02,793 --> 00:44:06,459
Juda ajoyib reja ekanligini o‘ylayman.

779
00:44:06,482 --> 00:44:09,325
Maqtovlaringizdan faxrlanaman.

780
00:44:09,349 --> 00:44:14,315
Batafsil smeta keyinroq elektron pochtada yuboraman.

781
00:44:14,338 --> 00:44:16,305
Kutib qolaman.

782
00:44:16,328 --> 00:44:21,161
Kompaniyamiz direktori sizga salomlarini yetkazishni so‘radi.

783
00:44:21,184 --> 00:44:23,017
Rahmat.

784
00:44:23,040 --> 00:44:25,276
Salomlarini yetkazing.

785
00:44:25,300 --> 00:44:30,385
Keyingi safar yangi mahsulot namunalarini olib kelaman.

786
00:44:30,408 --> 00:44:32,542
Buni qilganingiz uchun rahmat.

787
00:44:32,566 --> 00:44:34,465
Gamxo‘rlik shart emas.

788
00:44:34,488 --> 00:44:39,421
Bugun sizning ofisingizga tashrif buyurganimdan xursandman.

789
00:44:39,444 --> 00:44:42,578
Men ham siz bilan salomlashganimdan xursandman.

790
00:44:42,601 --> 00:44:46,334
Ertaga yana qo‘ng‘iroq qilaman.

791
00:44:46,357 --> 00:44:49,324
Qachon qo‘ng‘iroq qilasiz?

792
00:44:49,347 --> 00:44:52,227
Tushdan keyin soat uchda qo‘ng‘iroq qilaman.

793
00:44:52,250 --> 00:44:54,543
Tushunarli.

794
00:44:54,566 --> 00:44:57,737
Sizda savollar bormi?

795
00:44:57,760 --> 00:45:00,328
Hozircha yo'q.

796
00:45:00,352 --> 00:45:04,249
Bugun shu yerda xayr, xurmat bilan.

797
00:45:04,273 --> 00:45:06,744
Yo'lga ehtiyot bo'ling.

798
00:45:06,767 --> 00:45:10,500
Bandligingizda rahmat.

799
00:45:10,523 --> 00:45:13,057
Yana ko'rishguncha!

800
00:45:13,080 --> 00:45:14,446
Ha.

801
00:45:14,469 --> 00:45:18,036
Siz bilan yana uchrashishni intiqlik bilan kutaman.

802
00:45:18,059 --> 00:45:20,792
Sizning aloqangizni kutaman.

803
00:45:20,815 --> 00:45:23,415
Albatta, aloqaga chiqaman.

804
00:45:23,438 --> 00:45:25,972
Yordam va hamkorlik uchun rahmat.